      "content": "that's a good start but it feels a bit surface level. can u go deeper into the legal or philosophical side of it? like what are the actual structural or legislative arguments they use to say it's fundamentally unconstitutional or legally impossible? i want to make sure my post doesn't just sound like i'm summarizing 'feelings' but actually looks at the formal arguments.",
